      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Canadian Association of Radiologists. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "This pictorial essay demonstrates the variable appearances of ductal carcinoma in situ on full-field digital mammography, synthesized mammography, and digital breast tomosynthesis. The spectrum of intercase and intracase variability suggests further refinement of reconstruction algorithms for synthesized mammography may be necessary to maximize early detection of ductal carcinoma in situ."
